Z||000006||KRMFiero||02-08-2001||01:04 PM||||Watch out what amp you buy though, some no name ones like pyramid and companys like that even though they are very cheap they are not worth the money, I have owened a few no name amps and they dont last and they sound bad... if you want a good cheap amp go to radio shack, my favorite amp there is the 200 watt one (Very powerful, good sound, cheap) the 400 and 260 watt amps they sell there are also good, but the 50 watt and 110 they sell I reccomend not buying, they are junk<P>just trying to help you out<BR>Kyle||||reg||1
